      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35302001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "起——床——了——喵——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35302002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "呃——咳咳咳……救命……不要突然跳到床上……米菲亚……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35302003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "太好了，你还活着喵~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35302004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我只是睡着了，不是死了啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "35302006",
              "text": "如果我没看错的话，现在是凌晨三点？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "35302006",
              "text": "我没有睡很久吧？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "35302005",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35302006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "你已经有三个小时没有给米菲亚扫灰了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35302007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "|101|作为专属扫灰官，已经严重失职了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35302008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "原来是猫咪的分别焦虑啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35302009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "看在你最近表现还不错的份上，这是赏给你的奖励。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35302010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "难道是小鱼干吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35302011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "特制贴纸，上面有我的气味，这下不会有别的猫敢靠近你了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35302012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "决定了，就贴在你脸上吧，这是最显眼的位置。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
